      "role": "user",
      "content": "stop the signal... that's a heavy way to put it. but i guess i get what you mean. everything feels so loud and exhausting. if the universe really is just this empty void, then why is there so much pressure to keep struggling through it? it feels like i'm just fighting against something that's already decided i don't matter.",
